, and CI/CD credentials.</p><ul class="d_flex flex-wrap_wrap ai_center jc_center gap_12px li-t_none m_0 mt_lg p_10px"><li class="d_inline-flex ai_center gap_12px"><span class="d_inline-flex ai_center gap_sm"><div class="flex-sh_0 w_28px h_28px bdr_full ov_hidden"><div data-component="ResponsiveImage" class="pos_relative d_block ov_hidden"><div style="padding-top:100%" class="d_block"></div><picture class="pos_absolute inset_0 w_100% h_100%"><source srcSet="/next-public-assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fcgdhsj6q%2Fproduction%2F8373d736d15f4a1508851aca61368cd44fd61ca5-400x400.jpg%3Fw%3D56%26q%3D95%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=320&amp;q=90 320w" sizes="100vw"/><img alt="" src="/next-public-assets/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fcgdhsj6q%2Fproduction%2F8373d736d15f4a1508851aca61368cd44fd61ca5-400x400.jpg%3Fw%3D56%26q%3D95%26fit%3Dmax%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=1920&amp;q=90" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" class="d_block w_100% h_100% obj-f_cover"/></picture></div></div><span class="textStyle_paragraph-sm ff_body">Socket Research Team</span></span></li></ul></div><div class="w_100% max-w_calc((var(--grid-column-width)_*_6)_+_(var(--grid-gap)_*_5)) mx_auto mt_xl md:mt_2xl"><div class="d_flex ai_center gap_lg c_text.primary"><span class="d_inline-flex ai_center gap_10px flex-sh_0"><time class="textStyle_mono-md ff_mono tt_uppercase">Nov 17, 2026</time><span aria-hidden="true" class="textStyle_mono-md ff_mono">|</span><span class="textStyle_mono-md ff_mono tt_uppercase">2 min read</span></span><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex_1_1_auto min-w_var(--spacing-md) h_1px bg-i_repeating-linear-gradient(to_right,_{colors.text.tertiary}_0_2px,_transparent_2px_14px)"></div><div class="d_flex ai_center flex-sh_0 gap_md"><button type="button" aria-label="Export IOCs" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_7eolubt5ujlb_" class="d_inline-flex ai_center gap_sm h_32px px_sm bg_bg.white bd_1px_solid bd-c_border.ivory